OL,3,ATrump backs return of ex-Nvidia boss
OL,4,Aafter 'Bring Jensen Back' campaign
OL,5,Alaunched
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has created a crisis for one of the
OL,8,Fworld's most valuable firms, which is a
OL,9,Fkey part of the AI industry and its
OL,10,Fhuge expansion.
OL,12,FBut now fellow tech bosses, including
OL,13,FSpaceX's Elon Musk and Tim Sweeney,
OL,14,Fchief executive of Fortnite-maker Epic
OL,15,FGames, have backed a campaign to get
OL,16,FNvidia's board to "Bring Jensen Back".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
